hadiths[65]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1455","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum logon ko madanein paaogey. Unkey jaahiliyat mein behtar unkey Islam mein behtar hain jab wo samjhein. Aur tum is muamley mein logon mein sab se behtar use paaogey jo usey sab se zyada naapasand karta ho. Aur tum logon mein sab se bura do chehrey waley ko paaogey jo inkey paas chehrey key sath aata hai aur unkey paas chehrey key sath aata hai. (Bukhari: 3493-3494)"
"1456","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log is muamley mein Quraish key taabe hain. Unkey Musalman unkey Musalman key taabe hain aur unkey kaafir unkey kaafir key taabe hain. (Bukhari: 3495)"
"1457","[AI-translation] Aur log madanein hain. Unkey jaahiliyat mein behtar unkey Islam mein behtar hain jab wo samjhein. Tum logon mein sab se behtar use paaogey jo is muamley ko sab se zyada naapasand karta ho yahan tak ke wo us mein padey. (Bukhari: 3496)"
"1458","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quraish aur Ansaar aur Juhaina aur Muzaina aur Aslam aur Ashja aur Gifaar merey madadgaar hain. Unka Allah aur uskey Rasool key siwa madadgaar nahi hai. (Bukhari: 3504)"
"1459","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ye muamla Quraish mein rahega jab tak un mein se do baaqi rahein. (Bukhari: 3501)"
"1460","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Usmaan bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf chaley. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne Bani Muttalib ko diya aur hamein chhor diya. Jabke ham aur wo tum se aik darjey mein hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Haashim aur Bani Muttalib aik cheez hain. (Bukhari: 3502)"
"1461","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Koi aadmi jo apne baap key siwa kisi ki taraf mansoob ho jabke wo use jaanta ho magar kufr kya. Aur jo qaum ki taraf mansoob ho jismein uska nasab nahi hai to use aag mein apna thikaana banaana chaahiye. (Bukhari: 3508)"
"1462","[AI-translation] Waasila bin Asqa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se badey jhooton mein se hai ke aadmi apne baap key siwa kisi ki taraf mansoob ho. Ya apni aankh ko wo dikhaaey jo us ne nahi dekha. Ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wo kahey jo Aap ne nahi kaha. (Bukhari: 3509)"
"1463","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mimbar par farmaya: Gifaar ko Allah maaf farmaaey. Aur Aslam ko Allah salaamat rakkhey. Aur Usayya ne Allah aur uskey Rasool ki naafarmaani ki. (Bukhari: 3513)"
"1464","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Aqra bin Haabis ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Tum se Aslam aur Gifaar aur Muzaina mein se haajiyon key choron ne baiat ki hai, aur mera khayaal hai, aur Juhaina ne. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Batao agar Aslam aur Gifaar aur Muzaina, aur mera khayaal hai: Aur Juhaina, Bani Tameem aur Bani Aamir aur Asad aur Ghatfaan se behtar hon to wo naakaam aur nuksaan mein rahey? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo un se behtar hain. (Bukhari: 3516)"
"1465","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aslam aur Gifaar aur Muzaina mein se kuchh aur Juhaina, ya farmaya: Juhaina mein se kuchh ya Muzaina mein se, Allah key paas ya farmaya: Qiyaamat key din, Asad aur Tameem aur Hawaazin aur Ghatfaan se behtar hain. (Bukhari: 3517)"
"1466","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke Qahtaan mein se aadmi nikley jo logon ko apni laathi se haankeyga. (Bukhari: 3520)"
"1467","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwa kya jabke Aap key sath Muhaajireen mein se log jama ho gaey they yahan tak ke bahut ho gaey. Aur Muhaajireen mein khelne wala aadmi tha. To us ne Ansaari ko thokar maari. To Ansaari sakht ghussa hua yahan tak ke wo pukaarney lagey. Aur Ansaari ne kaha: Ae Ansaar! Aur Muhaajiri ne kaha: Ae Muhaajireen! To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur farmaya: Jaahiliyat walon ki pukaar kaisi hai? Phir farmaya: Unka kya haal hai? To Aap ko Muhaajiri key Ansaari ko thokar maarney ki khabar di gai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhoro, beshak wo gandi hai. Aur Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salool ne kaha: Kya wo ham par pukaarney lagey hain? Beshak agar ham Madina wapas aey to izzat wala us mein se zaleel ko zaroor nikaalega. To Umar ne kaha: Kya ham is khabees ko qatl na karein Ya Rasulullah? Abdullah key liye. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log baat na karein ke wo apne sahaaba ko qatl karta tha. (Bukhari: 3521). Khuzaa ki kahaani."
"1468","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amr bin Luhayy bin Qamaa bin Khindif jo Khuzaa ka baap hai. (Bukhari: 3520)"
"1469","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne Amr bin Aamir bin Luhayy Khuzaai ko dekha jo aag mein apni aantein ghaseet raha tha. Aur wo pehla tha jis ne saannd chhodey. (Bukhari: 3524). Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) key Islam laaney ki kahaani."
"1470","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Zarr ne kaha: Main Gifaar mein se aadmi tha. To hamein pahuncha ke Makkah mein aadmi nikla hai jo gumaan karta hai ke wo Nabi hai. To main ne apne bhai se kaha: Is aadmi ki taraf jao, us se baat karo aur merey paas uski khabar laao. To wo gaya aur us se mila. Phir wapas aaya. To main ne kaha: Tumharey paas kya hai? To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne aadmi dekha hai jo bhalai ka hukm deta hai aur buraai se rokta hai. To main ne us se kaha: Tum ne mujhey khabar se shifa nahi di. To main ne thaili aur laathi li. Phir Makkah ki taraf aaya. To main use na pehchaanta tha aur uskey baarey mein poochhna naapasand karta tha. Aur Zamzam ka paani peeta tha aur masjid mein hota tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To merey paas se Ali guzrey. To unhon-ne kaha: Goya aadmi ajnabi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Ghar ki taraf chalo. Unhon-ne kaha: To main uskey sath gaya. Wo mujh se kisi cheez key baarey mein na poochhtey they aur na main unhey khabar deta tha. Phir jab subah hui to main uskey baarey mein poochhney key liye masjid ki taraf subah gaya. Aur koi mujhey uskey baarey mein kuchh khabar na deta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To merey paas se Ali guzrey. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya aadmi ko abhi apna thikaana maloom na hua? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Merey sath chalo. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne kaha: Tumhaara muamla kya hai aur tumhey is shehar mein kya laaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne us se kaha: Agar tum mujh par chhupaao to main tumhey khabar dunga. Unhon-ne kaha: To beshak main karunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne us se kaha: Hamein pahuncha hai ke yahaan aadmi nikla hai jo gumaan karta hai ke wo Nabi hai. To main ne apne bhai ko bheja taake wo us se baat karey. To wo wapas aaya aur us ne mujhey khabar se shifa nahi di. To main ne chaaha ke main us se milun. To us ne us se kaha: Khabardaar! Beshak tum ne hidaayat paai hai. Mera chehra uski taraf hai. To merey peechey aao, jahaan main daakhil hun daakhil ho. Beshak agar main kisi ko dekhun jis se mujhey tum par khauf ho to main deewar ki taraf khada hunga goya main apna joota durust kar raha hun aur tum chaltey rehna. To wo chala aur main uskey sath chala. Yahan tak ke wo daakhil hua aur main uskey sath Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil hua. To main ne us se kaha: Mujh par Islam pesh karo. To us ne (Islam) pesh kya aur main usi jagah Musalman ho gaya. To us ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Is muamley ko chhupaao aur apne shehar wapas jao. Phir jab tumhey hamaara ghalba pahunchay to aana. To main ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Main unkey darmiyaan uskey sath cheekhunga. To wo masjid mein aaya jabke Quraish us mein they. To us ne kaha: Ae Quraish ki jamaat! Beshak main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad uska banda aur uska Rasool hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Is deen badalney waley ki taraf utho. To wo uthay aur mujhey maara gaya ke main marney laga. To mujhey Abbas ne paa liya aur mujh par jhuk gaey. Phir unki taraf aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Tum par afsos! Tum Gifaar mein se aadmi ko qatl kartey ho. Jabke tumhaari tijaarat aur tumhaara guzar Gifaar par hai. To wo mujh se hat gaey. Phir jab agley din subah hui to main wapas aaya aur main ne waisa kaha jaisa main ne kal kaha tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Is deen badalney waley ki taraf utho. To mujh se waisa kya gaya jaisa kal kya gaya tha. Aur mujhey Abbas ne paa liya aur mujh par jhuk gaey aur unhon-ne waisa kaha jaisa kal kaha tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To ye Abu Zarr key pehley Islam laaney ka tha. (Bukhari: 3522)"
"1471","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab (Aur apne qareebi rishtedaaron ko daraao) naazil hui to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pukaarney lagey: Ae Bani Fihr! Ae Bani Adi! Quraish key khaandaanon se! (Bukhari: 3531)"
"1472","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab (Aur apne qareebi rishtedaaron ko daraao) naazil hui to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pukaarney lagey: Ae Bani Fihr! Ae Bani Adi! Quraish key khaandaanon se! (Bukhari: 3531)"
"1473","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey paanch naam hain: Main Muhammad hun. Aur Ahmad. Aur main Maahi hun jiskey sath Allah kufr ko mitaata hai. Aur main Haashir hun jiskay qadmon par log jama kiye jaaengey. Aur main Aaqib hun. (Bukhari: 3532)"
"1474","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhey taajjub nahi hota ke Allah mujh se Quraish ki gaali aur unki laanat ko kaisey pherta hai. Wo Muzammam ko gaali detey hain aur Muzammam par laanat kartey hain. Jabke main Muhammad hun. (Bukhari: 3534)"
"1475","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur Nabiyon ki misaal aisey aadmi jaisi hai jis ne ghar banaaya aur use poora kya aur khubsurat banaaya magar eent ki jagah (chhori). To log us mein daakhil hotey aur taajjub kartey aur kehtey: Eent ki jagah kyun na (bharti)? (Bukhari: 3534)"
"1476","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak meri aur mujh se pehley Nabiyon ki misaal aisey aadmi jaisi hai jis ne ghar banaaya aur use khubsurat aur haseen banaaya magar koney mein eent ki jagah (chhori). To log uskey gird ghoomney lagey aur us par taajjub karney lagey aur kehtey: Ye eent kyun na rakkhi gai? Aap ne farmaya: To main eent hun aur main Nabiyon key aakhir hun. (Bukhari: 3535)"
"1477","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jabke Aap tirsath saal key they. (Bukhari: 3536)"
"1478","[AI-translation] Saaeb bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha jabke wo chauranbe saal key tandrust seedhey they: Main jaan chuka hun jo mujhey merey kaan aur meri aankh se faeda diya gaya magar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dua se. Beshak meri khaala mujhey Aap key paas ley gaein aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mera bhatija beemaar hai, to Allah se uskey liye dua kijiye. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne merey liye dua ki. (Bukhari: 3540)"
"1479","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Asr padhi, phir nikley aur paidal chaley. To Hasan ko bachchon key sath khelta hua dekha. To use apne kandhey par utha liya aur kaha: Merey baap tum par qurbaan! Nabi se mushaabeh hai, Ali se mushaabeh nahi hai. Jabke Ali hans rahey hain. (Bukhari: 3542)"
"1480","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha. Jabke Hasan bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) Aap se mushaabeh they. Main ne Abu Juhaifa se kaha: Mujhey Aapka huliya bataao. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo safed they jabke budhapey key baal they. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamaarey liye tairaah jawaan oontniyon ka hukm diya. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se pehley faut ho gaey ke ham unhey qabz kartey. (Bukhari: 3544)"
"1481","[AI-translation] Nabi key saathi Abdullah bin Busr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha? Kya Aap budhey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Aapki thodi mein safed baal they. (Bukhari: 3546)"
"1482","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qaum mein darmiyaana qad they. Na lambay aur na chhotey. Roshan rang waley, na bahut safed be-noor aur na gendum rang. Na ghungryaaley sakht baalon waley aur na seedhey naram baalon waley. Aap par naazil hua jab Aap chaalees saal key they. To Aap Makkah mein das saal rahey jab Aap par naazil hota raha aur Madina mein das saal. Aur Aap faut huey jabke Aap key sar aur Aapki daadhi mein bees safed baal na they. (Bukhari: 3547)"
"1483","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na wazeh lambay aur na chhotey. Aur na bahut safed be-noor aur na gendum rang. Aur na ghungryaaley sakht baalon waley aur na seedhey. Allah ne Aap ko chaalees saal key shuru mein bheja. Aur hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 3548)"
"1484","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein sab se haseen chehrey aur sab se haseen khilqat waley they. Na wazeh lambay aur na chhotey. (Bukhari: 3549)"
"1485","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khizaab lagaaya tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Beshak Aapki kaanpattiyon mein kuchh tha. (Bukhari: 3550)"

"1486","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) darmiyaana qad they jabke donon kandhon key darmiyaan faasla tha. Aap key baal Aap key kaan ki lau tak pahunchtey they. Main ne Aap ko surkh jodey mein dekha, main ne kabhi kuchh Aap se haseen nahi dekha. (Bukhari: 3551)"
"1487","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Bara Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, un se kaha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra talwaar jaisa tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, balke chaand jaisa. (Bukhari: 3552)"
"1488","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Batha mein namaz padhtey huey dekha jabke Aap key saamney nezah tha. Hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: To log Aap key donon haathon ko pakadney lagey aur un se apne chehrey maltey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Aapka haath pakda aur use apne chehrey par rakkha. Phir wo barf se zyada thanda aur musk se zyada umda khushbu wala tha. (Bukhari: 3553)"
"1489","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Bani Aadam key zamano mein sab se behtar zamaney se bheja gaya hun, zamana se zamaney tak. Yahan tak ke main us zamaney mein tha jis mein main tha. (Bukhari: 3557)"
"1490","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baal latkaatey they jabke mushrikeen apne saron ki maang nikaaltey they. To Kitaab waley apne saron ko latkaatey they. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kitaab walon ki mawafiqat pasand kartey they jismein Aap ko kisi cheez ka hukm nahi diya gaya tha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sar ki maang nikaali. (Bukhari: 3558)"
"1491","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fahhash aur na fahhash ban-ney waley they. Aur farmatey they: Beshak tum mein sab se behtar wo hain jo akhlaaq mein sab se achhey hain. (Bukhari: 3559)"
"1492","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko do muamley key darmiyaan ikhtiyaar nahi diya gaya magar Aap ne un donon mein aasaan liya jab tak wo gunaah na hota. Phir agar wo gunaah hota to logon mein sab se door hotey us se. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne aap key liye badla nahi liya magar ye ke Allah ki hurmat todi jaey to uskey sath Allah key liye badla letey. (Bukhari: 3560)"
"1493","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne resham aur deebaaj ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheli se zyada naram nahi chhua. Aur main ne khushbu kabhi ya itr kabhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khushbu ya itr se zyada umda nahi soonghi. (Bukhari: 3561)"
"1494","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pardey mein kunwaari se zyada sharmilay they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur jab Aap kisi cheez ko naapasand kartey to usey Aap key chehrey mein pehchaana jaata. (Bukhari: 3562)"
"1495","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pardey mein kunwaari se zyada sharmilay they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur jab Aap kisi cheez ko naapasand kartey to usey Aap key chehrey mein pehchaana jaata. (Bukhari: 3562)"
"1496","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaana kabhi aib na lagaaya. Agar Aap use chaahtey to khaatey warna chhor detey."
"1497","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hadees bayan kartey they ke agar gin-ney wala ginta to use gin leta. (Bukhari: 3567)"
"1498","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hadees ko tumhaarey bayan ki tarah jaldi jaldi na bayan kartey they. (Bukhari: 3568)"
"1499","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se us raat ki hadees bayan kartey hain jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Kaaba ki masjid se seyr karaai gai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap key paas teen aadmi aey us se pehley ke Aap par wahi ki jaey jabke Aap Masjid-e-Haraam mein soey huey they. To un mein se pehley ne kaha: Un mein wo kaun hai? To un mein se darmiyaani ne kaha: Wo un mein sab se behtar hai. Aur aakhri ne kaha: Un mein sab se behtar ko lo. To wo thi. To Aap ne unhey na dekha yahan tak ke wo doosri raat aey jismein Aapka dil dekhta tha. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aankhein soti thein aur Aapka dil na sota tha. Aur aise hi Nabi sote hain, unki aankhein soten aur unkey dil na soten. To Jibreel Aap key wali huey, phir Aap ko aasmaan ki taraf ley gaey. (Bukhari: 3570)"
"1500","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas bartan laaya gaya jabke Aap Zaura mein they. To Aap ne bartan mein apna haath rakkha aur paani Aapki ungliyon key darmiyaan se nikalney laga. To qaum ne wuzu kya. Anas se kaha gaya: Tum kitney they? Unhon-ne kaha: Teen sau ya teen sau key qareeb. (Bukhari: 3572). Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baaz nikalney mein nikley jabke Aap key sath Aap key sahaaba mein se log they. To wo chaltey rahey. To namaz ka waqt aaya aur unhey paani na mila jis se wuzu kartey. To qaum mein se aadmi gaya aur paani ka chhota pyaala ley kar aaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use liya aur wuzu kya, phir apni chaar ungliyaan pyaaley par phailaain. Phir farmaya: Utho aur wuzu karo. To qaum ne wuzu kya yahan tak ke wo wuzu mein pahunch gaey jo wo chaaahtey they. Aur wo sattar ya uskey qareeb they. (3574). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1501","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham nishaaniyon ko barkat shumaar kartey they jabke tum unhey daraawa shumaar kartey ho. Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they aur paani kam ho gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Paani ka bacha hua talaash karo. To wo bartan ley kar aey jis mein thoda paani tha. To Aap ne bartan mein apna haath daakhil kya, phir farmaya: Mubaarak paaki par aao jabke barkat Allah se hai. To main ne paani ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon key darmiyaan se nikalta hua dekha. Aur beshak ham khaaney ki tasbeeh suntey they jabke wo khaaya jaata tha. (Bukhari: 3579). Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jumuah key din darkht ya khajoor ki taraf khadey hotey they. To Ansaar ki aurat ya aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham tumharey liye mimbar na banaaein? Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaaaho. To unhon-ne Aap key liye mimbar banaaya. Phir jab Jumuah ka din tha to mimbar ki taraf dhakela gaya. To khajoor bachchey jaisa cheekhi. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey aur use apne sath lagaa liya. Wo bachchey jaisa roti thi jise khaamosh kya jaata hai. Aap ne farmaya: Wo us par roti thi jo wo uskey paas zikr sunti thi. (3584). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1502","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum qaum se lado jinkey jootey baal key hongey. Aur hadees lambai key sath guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat key aakhir mein farmaya: Aur tum mein se kisi par zamaana zaroor aaeyga ke wo mujhey dekhey, wo usey us se zyada mehboob hoga ke uskey liye uskey ghar waley aur uska maal ho. (Bukhari: 3587-3589 aur hadees number 2928 dekhein)"
"1503","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke tum Khuz aur Kirmaan se lado jo Ajamiyon mein se hain. Surkh chehron waley chapti naakon waley chhoti aankhon waley, unkey chehrey hathodi se pitee huey dhaal hain, unkey jootey baal key hain. (Bukhari: 3590). Adi bin Haatim se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas tha ke Aap key paas aadmi aaya aur us ne Aap se faqr ki shikaayat ki. Phir Aap key paas doosra aaya aur us ne Aap se raah katney ki shikaayat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Adi! Kya tum ne Heera dekha hai? Main ne kaha: Main ne use nahi dekha hai. Aur mujhey uskey baarey mein khabar di gai hai. Aap ne farmaya: Phir agar tumhaari zindagi lambi hui to tum zaroor oontni ko Heera se kooch karti hui dekhogey yahan tak ke wo Kaaba ka tawaaf karegi jabke wo Allah key siwa kisi se na daregi. Main ne apne aur apne dil key darmiyaan kaha: To Tayy key daakoo kahaan hongey jinhon-ne shehron mein aag lagaai hai? Aur agar tumhaari zindagi lambi hui to Kisra key khazaanay zaroor fatah kiye jaaengey. Main ne kaha: Kisra bin Hurmuz? Aap ne farmaya: Kisra bin Hurmuz. Aur agar tumhaari zindagi lambi hui to tum zaroor aadmi ko dekhogey jo apni hatheli bhar sona ya chaandi nikaalega aur usey qabool karney wala talaash karega aur use qabool karney wala koi na paaeyga. Aur tum mein se koi Allah se zaroor milega jis din wo us se milega jabke uskey aur uskey darmiyaan tarjumaan na hoga jo uskey liye tarjuma karey. To wo us se zaroor kahega: Kya main ne tumhaari taraf Rasool bhej kar nahi pahunchaaya? To wo kahega: Kyun nahi. To wo kahega: Kya main ne tumhey maal nahi diya aur tum par fazl nahi kya? To wo kahega: Kyun nahi. To wo apne daaen taraf dekhega aur Jahannum key siwa na dekhega. Aur apne baaen taraf dekhega aur Jahannum key siwa na dekhega. Adi ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aag se bacho agarchey khajoor key tukdey se. Phir jo khajoor ka tukda na paaey to achhi baat se. Adi ne kaha: To main ne oontni ko Heera se kooch karti hui dekha yahan tak ke wo Kaaba ka tawaaf karti thi jabke wo Allah key siwa na darti thi. Aur main un mein tha jinhon-ne Kisra bin Hurmuz key khazaanay fatah kiye. Aur agar tumhaari zindagi lambi hui to tum zaroor dekhogey jo Nabi Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo apni hatheli bhar nikaalega. (3595). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1504","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ko Quraish ka ye qabeela halaak karega. Unhon-ne kaha: To tum hamein kya hukm detey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Kaash log un se alag ho jaatey! (Bukhari: 3604)"
"1505","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Sacha Tasdeeq kiye gaey ko farmatey huey suna: Meri ummat ki halaakat Quraish mein se ladkon key haathon hogi. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Agar chaaaho to main unkey naam lun: Bani fulaan aur Bani fulaan. (Bukhari: 3605)"
"1506","[AI-translation] Huzaifa bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhalai key baarey mein poochhtey they aur main Aap se buraai key baarey mein poochhta tha, is khauf se ke wo mujhey paa ley. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham jaahiliyat aur buraai mein they. To Allah hamein ye bhalai dey kar aaya. To kya is bhalai key baad buraai mein se hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Main ne kaha: Aur kya us buraai key baad bhalai mein se hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan aur us mein dhund hai. Main ne kaha? Aur uska dhund kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Qaum jo meri hidaayat key siwa hidaayat detey hain. Tum un mein pehchaanogey aur inkaar karogey. Main ne kaha: To kya us bhalai key baad buraai mein se hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Jahannum key darwaazon ki taraf bul aaney waley. Jo unhey uski taraf jawaab dega wo use us mein phenkengey. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamein unki sifat bataaiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo hamaari khaal mein se hain aur hamaari zabaanon se baat kartey hain. Main ne kaha: To tum mujhey kya hukm detey ho agar wo mujhey paa ley? Aap ne farmaya: Musalmaanon ki jamaat aur unkey Imam key sath raho. Main ne kaha: Phir agar unki jamaat aur na Imam ho? Aap ne farmaya: To un tamaam firqon se alag ho jao agarchey tumhey darkht ki jad chabaani padey yahan tak ke tumhey maut aaey jabke tum us par ho. (Bukhari: 3606)"
"1507","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Jab main tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan karun to mera aasmaan se girna mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai ke main Aap par jhoot bolun. Aur jab main tumhey apne aur tumharey darmiyaan bayan karun to beshak ladai dhoka hai. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aakhri zamaaney mein qaum aaeygi jo kam umr daanton waley bewaqoof dimaghon waley hongey. Wo makhlooq key behtareen qaul mein se kahengey. Wo Islam se nikal jaaengey jaisa teer shikaar se nikal jaata hai. Unka imaan unkey halqon se aagey na badhega. To jahaan unhey paao unhey qatl karo. Beshak unkey qatl mein uskey liye ajr hai jo unhey Qiyaamat key din qatl karey. (Bukhari: 3611)"
"1508","[AI-translation] Khabbaab bin Arat (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shikaayat ki jabke Aap Kaaba key saayey mein apni chaadar ka takiya lagaaey huey they. Ham ne Aap se kaha: Kya tum hamaarey liye madad na maangogey? Kya tum Allah se hamaarey liye dua na karogey? Aap ne farmaya: Tum se pehlon mein aadmi key liye zameen mein khoda jaata tha aur use us mein rakkha jaata tha. To aara ley kar uskey sar par rakkha jaata tha aur use do mein cheera jaata tha. Aur wo use uskey deen se na rokta tha. Aur lohey ki kanghiyon se uskey gosht key neechey haddi ya nas se kangha kya jaata tha. Aur wo use uskey deen se na rokta tha. Aur Allah ki qasam Aap is muamley ko zaroor poora karega yahan tak ke sawaar Sanaa se Hazramaut tak chaleyga aur Allah key siwa na darega ya bhediye se apni bakriyon par. Lekin tum jaldi kartey ho. (Bukhari: 3612)"
"1509","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Saabit bin Qais ko gum paaya. To aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main tumharey liye uska ilm jaanta hun. To wo uskey paas aaya aur use apne ghar mein baitha hua paaya jabke us ne apna sar jhukaaya hua tha. To us ne kaha: Tumhara kya haal hai? To us ne kaha: Bura! Wo apni aawaaz Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aawaaz se buland karta tha. To uska amal zaaya ho gaya hai aur wo aag walon mein se hai. To aadmi aaya aur Aap ko khabar di ke us ne aisa aisa kaha. To wo aakhri martaba badi khushkhabri key sath wapas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Uskey paas jao aur us se kaho ke tum aag walon mein se nahi ho. Lekin Jannat walon mein se ho. (Bukhari: 3613)"
"1510","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aadmi ne Kahf padhi jabke ghar mein jaanwar tha. To wo badakney laga. To us ne salaam kya. Phir dhund ya baadal ne use dhaanp liya. To us ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Padho ae fulaan! Beshak wo sukoon hai jo Quran key liye naazil hua. Ya Quran key liye utra. (Bukhari: 3614). Bara bin Aazib se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) merey waalid key paas unkey ghar mein aey aur un se kajawa khareeda. To unhon-ne Aazib se kaha: Apne betey ko bhejo ke wo merey sath uthaaey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne use uskey sath uthaaya. Aur merey waalid uski qeemat wasool karney nikley. To merey waalid ne us se kaha: Ae Abu Bakr! Mujhey bayan karo ke tum ne kaisey kya tha jab tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat ko chaley they. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Ham ne apni raat aur agley din safar kya yahan tak ke dopahar ka khada honay wala khada hua aur raasta khaali ho gaya, us mein koi na chalta tha. To hamaarey liye lamba patthar uthaaya gaya jiska saaya tha jis par sooraj nahi aaya tha. To ham uskey paas utrey aur main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye apne haath se jagah baraabar ki jis par Aap soein aur us mein posteen bichaai. Aur main ne kaha: So jao Ya Rasulullah jabke main tumharey gird ki hifaazat karta hun. To Aap so gaey aur main Aap key gird ki hifaazat key liye nikla. Phir main charwaahay se mila jo apni bakriyon key sath patthar ki taraf aata tha, us se waisa chaahta tha jaisa ham ne chaaha tha. To main ne us se kaha: Tum kiske ho ae ladkey? To us ne kaha: Madina ya Makkah key aadmi ka. Main ne kaha: Kya tumhaari bakriyon mein doodh hai? Us ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: Kya tum dohtey ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. To us ne bakri pakdi. To main ne kaha: Than ko mitti aur baal aur gandagi se jhaado. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Bara ko dekha jo apne aik haath ko doosrey par maar raha tha aur jhaad raha tha. To us ne pyaaley mein doodh ka gaadha doh diya. Aur merey paas bart an tha jo main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye laaya tha jis se Aap seeraab hotey they. Us se peetey aur wuzu kartey. To main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur main ne Aap ko jagaana naapasand kya. To main Aap ko us waqt mila jab Aap jaagey. To main ne doodh par paani daala yahan tak ke uska neechey thanda ho gaya. To main ne kaha: Piyo Ya Rasulullah! Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne piya yahan tak ke main raazi ho gaya. Phir farmaya: Kya kooch ka waqt nahi aaya? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham kooch kar gaey jab sooraj dhal gaya tha. Aur hamaarey peechey Suraaqa bin Maalik aaya. To main ne kaha: Ham paa liye gaey Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Gham na karo, beshak Allah hamaarey sath hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par baddua ki aur uska ghoda uskey pet tak dhans gaya. Mera khayaal hai sakht zameen mein. Zuhair ko shak hua. To us ne kaha: Beshak main tumhey dekh raha hun ke tum donon ne mujh par baddua ki hai. To merey liye dua karo. Allah tumhaarey liye hai ke main tum donon se talaash hat aaunga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey liye dua ki aur wo bach gaya. To wo kisi se na milta magar kehta: Main ne tumhaarey yahaan ka kaafi kar diya hai. To wo kisi se na milta magar use wapas karta. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo hamaarey liye poora utra. (3615). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1511","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dehaati key paas uski ayaadat key liye daakhil huey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab beemaar ki ayaadat key liye uskey paas daakhil hotey to farmaatey: Koi harj nahi, paaki hai agar Allah ne chaaha. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Koi harj nahi, paaki hai agar Allah ne chaaha. Us ne kaha: Tum ne kaha: Paaki? Hargiz nahi, balke bukhaar hai jo budhey aadmi par ubalta hai ya bhadakta hai jo use qabron ki ziyaarat karaata hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To haan phir. (Bukhari: 3616)"
"1512","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Isaai tha aur Musalman hua aur Baqarah aur Aale Imraan padhi. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye likhta tha. To wo Isaai ho gaya. To wo kehta tha: Muhammad nahi jaantey magar jo main ne uskey liye likha. To Allah ne use maut di aur unhon-ne use dafan kya. To subah hui jabke zameen ne use nikaal diya tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ye Muhammad aur uskey sahaaba ka kaam hai. Jab wo un se bhaaga to unhon-ne hamaarey saathi ko qabr se nikaala aur use daal diya. To unhon-ne uskey liye khoda aur gehra kya. To subah hui jabke zameen ne use nikaal diya tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ye Muhammad aur uskey sahaaba ka kaam hai. Unhon-ne hamaarey saathi ko qabr se nikaala jab wo un se bhaaga aur use qabr key baahar daal diya. To unhon-ne uskey liye khoda aur uskey liye zameen mein jitna ho saka gehra kya. To subah hui jabke zameen ne use nikaal diya tha. To unhon-ne jaan liya ke wo logon mein se nahi hai. To unhon-ne use phenk diya. (Bukhari: 3617)"
"1513","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumharey paas bistar hain? Main ne kaha: Aur hamaarey paas bistar kahaan honge? Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak tumharey paas bistar honge. To main us se kehta hun, yaani apni biwi se: Apne bistar mujh se door karo. To wo kehti hai: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi farmaya: Beshak tumharey paas bistar honge? To main use chhor deta hun. (Bukhari: 3631)"
"1514","[AI-translation] Saad bin Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Umayya bin Khalaf se kaha: Beshak main ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna hai jo gumaan kartey hain ke wo tumhey qatl karney wala hai. Us ne kaha: Mujhey? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam Muhammad jab baat kartey hain to jhoot nahi boltey. To use Allah ne Badr mein qatl kya. Aur hadees mein qissa hai, ye hadees ka khulaasa us mein se hai. (Bukhari: 3632)"
"1515","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Jibreel (Alaihissalam) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey jabke Aap key paas Umm Salma thein. To wo baat karney lagey phir uthay. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umm Salma se farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Us ne kaha: Ye Dihya hain. Umm Salma ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne use hi samjha tha. Yahan tak ke main ne Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khutba suna jo Jibreel ki khabar deta tha, ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya. (Bukhari: 3634)"
"1516","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne logon ko maidaan mein jama dekha. To Abu Bakr khadey huey aur unhon-ne aik ya do dol kheenchey jabke unkey kheenchney mein kamzori thi. Aur Allah unhey maaf farmaaey. Phir use Umar ne liya aur wo unkey haath mein bada dol ban gaya. To main ne logon mein aqalmand nahi dekha jo uskey kaat-ney jaisa kaatey yahan tak ke logon ne oonton key bithaanay ki jagah bana li. (Bukhari: 3633)"
"1517","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Yahood Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se zikr kya ke un mein se aadmi aur aurat ne zina kya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum Tauraat mein rajm key muamley mein kya paatey ho? To unhon-ne kaha: Ham unhey ruswa kartey hain aur kodey maartey hain. To Abdullah bin Salaam ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha. Beshak us mein rajm hai. To wo Tauraat ley kar aey aur use phailaaya. To un mein se aik ne apna haath rajm ki aayat par rakkha aur us se pehley aur uskey baad padha. To Abdullah bin Salaam ne us se kaha: Apna haath uthao. To us ne apna haath uthaaya. Phir us mein rajm ki aayat thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha ae Muhammad, us mein rajm ki aayat hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon key baarey mein hukm diya aur wo rajm kiye gaey. (Bukhari: 3635)"
"1518","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Chaand Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein do tukdon mein phat gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gawaah raho! (Bukhari: 3636)"
"1519","[AI-translation] Urwa Baariqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use deenaar diya taake wo uskey sath Aap key liye bakri khareedey. To us ne uskey sath uskey liye do bakriyaan khareedein. To us ne un mein se aik deenaar key badley bechi. Aur Aap key paas deenaar aur bakri ley kar aaya. To Aap ne uskey liye uski be mein barkat ki dua ki. Aur wo agar mitti khareedta to us mein nafa paata. (Bukhari: 3642). Sahaaba key fazael ki kitaab."
